                                                <li><strong>Initialization:</strong> Creates sample data on first run</li>
                                                <li><strong>Demonstration:</strong> Shows common library operations</li>
                                                <li><strong>Error handling:</strong> Catches and logs exceptions</li>
                                                <li><strong>Data persistence:</strong> Loads and saves data automatically</li>
